# Poojaspace — Google OAuth Configuration
#
# Create a Web Client ID in Google Cloud Console:
# 1. Project -> APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create Credentials -> OAuth client ID
# 2. Application type: Web application
# 3. Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173, https://your-production-domain.com
#
# NOTE: This client ID is public and bundled into the client PWA.
# NEVER place a client secret or refresh token in any VITE_ variable or client code!
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com
